{"created": "2026-02-17T09:59:22.276074+00:00", "modified": "2026-03-18T15:46:51.604547+00:00", "id": 18668846, "conceptrecid": "17515762", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18668846", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.17515762", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18668846", "metadata": {"title": "River biofilm bacteria as sentinels of national-scale freshwater ecosystems", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18668846", "publication_date": "2025-02-17", "description": "<p>Supplementary data associated with <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/gcb.70809\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">River biofilm bacteria as sentinels of national-scale freshwater ecosystems</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>R scripts for generation of these files and visualisation are available on GitHub at: <a href=\"https://github.com/amycthorpe/biofilm_16S_analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://github.com/amycthorpe/biofilm_16S_analysis</a>.</p>\n<p>Raw reads have been deposited in the European Nucleotide Archive (ENA) at EMBL-EBI under accession number PRJEB90117</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ASV_tax_16S_processed.csv - ASV taxonomy (assigned according to the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.arb-silva.de/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SILVA v138.2</a> reference database)</li>\n<li>ASV_counts_16S_processed.csv - ASV abundances per sample</li>\n<li>water_chem.csv - water chemistry associated&nbsp;with each sample [source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://environment.data.gov.uk/water-quality/view/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://environment.data.gov.uk/water-quality/view/landing</a>]\n<ul>\n<li>values are means calculated for each variable across a 3-month period prior to sampling</li>\n<li>alkalinity to pH 4.5 as CaCO3 (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>ammonia unionised as N (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>ammonical nitrogen as N (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>dissolved organic carbon (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>chloride ion (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>conductivity at 25 &deg;C</li>\n<li>nitrate as N (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>nitrite as N (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>total oxidised nitrogen (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>reactive orthophosphate (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>dissolved oxygen (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>dissolved oxygen (% saturation)</li>\n<li>total phosphorus (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>reactive silica as SiO2 (mg L-1)</li>\n<li>water temperature (&deg;C)</li>\n<li>pH</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>diversity.csv - alpha diversity and richness metrics per sample</li>\n<li>core.csv - core community at each detection threshold and their prevalence across samples (%)</li>\n<li>envfit.csv - results from vegan envfit() function for NMDS analysis of ASV relative abundance and water chemistry</li>\n<li>correlations.csv - results from spearman correlation analysis between ASV relative abundance and water chemistry</li>\n<li>modules.csv - co-occurrence network module assignment</li>\n<li>titan_all.csv - output from TITAN for alkalinity, DO, nitrate-N, and temperature.</li>\n<li>functions_ASV.csv - predicted functions according to the <a href=\"https://pages.uoregon.edu/slouca/LoucaLab/archive/FAPROTAX/lib/php/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FAPROTAX</a> database.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Thorpe, Amy", "affiliation": "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology", "orcid": "0000-0003-0210-2767"}, {"name": "Busi, Susheel Bhanu", "affiliation": "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology", "orcid": "0000-0001-7559-3400"}, {"name": "Warren, Jonathan", "affiliation": "Environment Agency", "orcid": "0000-0003-3381-3852"}, {"name": "Newbold, Lindsay", "affiliation": "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology", "orcid": "0000-0001-8895-1406"}, {"name": "Taylor, Joe", "affiliation": "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology", "orcid": "0000-0003-0095-0869"}, {"name": "Walsh, Kerry", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-8619-8895"}, {"name": "Read, Daniel", "affiliation": "UK Centre for Ecology & Hydrology", "orcid": "0000-0001-8546-5154"}], "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/amycthorpe/biofilm_16S_analysis"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "datase